# Secrets and carried-over credential material. Never commit these.
#
# secrets.sh is NOT here on purpose: it contains no secrets, it fetches them
# from Key Vault with an interactive Entra login. It is meant to be committed,
# and it is what replaces env.sh below.
env.sh
seed_users.sql
seed-users.sh
*.pem

# Written at runtime by the tsx harnesses to stub Next's `server-only` alias,
# which plain Node cannot resolve.
harness/.server-only-shim.js
